{"schema":"asx.scenario.v2","id":"mpsc-recv-many-wakes-each-freed-slot-001","description":"Two producers wait on a full mpsc (t.a parks first, then t.b). A recv_many that frees both slots wakes both of them (Rust sender_wakers_for_freed_slots, mpsc.rs:402-423); only the head of the line may claim a slot and its claim wakes the next (:1081-1110), so the dispatch order shows both woken at once. The receiver's next batch is [3,4] (bd-9kll.5.7).","unit":"mpsc","rules":["inv.determinism.replayable"],"seed":42,"lab":{"max_steps":1000},"regions":[{"name":"r.main","parent":"root","budget":null}],"channels":[{"name":"ch","type":"mpsc","capacity":2,"sender":"t.a","senders":["t.b"],"receiver":"t.r"}],"sync":[],"tasks":[{"name":"t.a","region":"r.main","budget":null,"program":[{"op":"try_send","channel":"ch","value":1},{"op":"try_send","channel":"ch","value":2},{"op":"send","channel":"ch","value":3},{"op":"trace","message":"a sent"}]},{"name":"t.b","region":"r.main","budget":null,"program":[{"op":"sleep","ns":10},{"op":"send","channel":"ch","value":4},{"op":"trace","message":"b sent"}]},{"name":"t.r","region":"r.main","budget":null,"program":[{"op":"sleep","ns":100},{"op":"recv_many","channel":"ch","limit":2},{"op":"recv_many","channel":"ch","limit":4},{"op":"trace","message":"r done"}]}],"script":[],"expect":{"kind":"ok"}}
